title: "Apnoeic oxygenation model"
abstract: >-
  A computational model of gas exchange during apnoea after intravenous
  induction, comparing a patent airway against complete obstruction and
  quantifying the effect of buccal oxygen delivery. Eighty parallel
  ventilation/perfusion compartments with emergent shunt, a coupled
  circulation, and benchmarks against clinical measurement. Implemented
  twice, in Python and JavaScript, held to agreement within 1%. See
  SOURCES.md for what each benchmark rests on and which sources have
  actually been read.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Heard
    given-names: A. M. B.
